  "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><meta name=\"typography\" content=\"classic\" /><p data-lake-id=\"u28d5eb51\" id=\"u28d5eb51\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u5720f426\" id=\"u5720f426\" class=\"lake-fontsize-22\" style=\"color: var(--yq-text-primary)\">1</span></strong><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u6474ea88\" id=\"u6474ea88\" class=\"lake-fontsize-22\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\">使用python-periphery</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u956a5744\" id=\"u956a5744\" class=\"lake-fontsize-22\" style=\"color: var(--yq-text-primary)\"><br /></span><a href=\"https://python-periphery.readthedocs.io/en/latest/index.html\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u638b0690\" id=\"u638b0690\"><span data-lake-id=\"u8b9ede71\" id=\"u8b9ede71\">python-periphery</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"u6bcd09c4\" id=\"u6bcd09c4\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\"> 库支持的PWM输出是基于Linux的PWM子系统实现的，所以要想利用该库做PWM输出， 需要板卡提供支持。像泰山派板卡，就可以完美使用 </span><a href=\"https://python-periphery.readthedocs.io/en/latest/index.html\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u85d238bf\" id=\"u85d238bf\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua8b9567d\" id=\"ua8b9567d\">python-periphery</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"u40ca6403\" id=\"u40ca6403\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\"> 库实现PWM输出。 这样这样一来，就不需要我们在软件层面上利用GPIO模拟PWM输出。</span></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"KdlVh\" id=\"KdlVh\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u566ab0de\" id=\"u566ab0de\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\">安装 python-periphery</span></h2><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23%20%E5%9C%A8%E6%9D%BF%E5%8D%A1%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E5%A6%82%E4%B8%8B%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4%E5%AE%89%E8%A3%85%5Cnsudo%20pip3%20install%20python-periphery%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22HKWtw%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h2 data-lake-id=\"BoGHC\" id=\"BoGHC\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"ufd4696ab\" id=\"ufd4696ab\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\">periphery输出PWM</span></h2><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22from%20periphery%20import%20PWM%5Cnimport%20time%5Cn%5Cntry%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%E5%8D%A0%E7%A9%BA%E6%AF%94%E9%80%92%E5%A2%9E%E6%AD%A5%E9%95%BF%5Cn%20%20%20%20step%20%3D%200.05%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89range%E6%9C%80%E5%A4%A7%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4%5Cn%20%20%20%20rangeMax%20%3D%20int(1%2F0.05)%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E5%85%B7%E4%BD%93%E7%9A%84PWM%E7%9A%84%E5%BC%95%E8%84%9A%3A%20%E5%8F%82%E6%95%B0%E4%B8%80%EF%BC%9A%20%E5%85%B7%E4%BD%93%E6%98%AF%E5%93%AA%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AAPWM%20%EF%BC%8Cchip%E5%87%A0%E5%B0%B1%E5%86%99%E5%87%A0%20(8%2C9%2C14%20%E5%AF%B9%E5%BA%94%20chip0%20%2C%20chip1%20%2Cchip2)%EF%BC%8C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20%E5%8F%82%E6%95%B0%E4%BA%8C%EF%BC%9A%20%E8%BF%99%E4%B8%AAPWM%E7%9A%84%E7%AC%AC%E5%87%A0%E4%B8%AA%E9%80%9A%E9%81%93%3F%20PWM_M%3F%20%20%E8%BF%99%E4%B8%AA%3F%20%E6%98%AF%E4%BB%80%E4%B9%88%E5%B0%B1%E5%86%99%E4%BB%80%E4%B9%88%E3%80%82%E4%B8%80%E8%88%AC%E6%98%AF%E9%80%9A%E9%81%930%5Cn%20%20%20%20pwm%20%3D%20PWM(0%2C%200)%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20%E8%AE%BE%E7%BD%AEPWM%E8%BE%93%E5%87%BA%E9%A2%91%E7%8E%87%E4%B8%BA%201%20kHz%5Cn%20%20%20%20pwm.frequency%20%3D%201e3%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20%E8%AE%BE%E7%BD%AE%E5%8D%A0%E7%A9%BA%E6%AF%94%E4%B8%BA%200%25%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E5%91%A8%E6%9C%9F%E5%86%85%E9%AB%98%E7%94%B5%E5%B9%B3%E7%9A%84%E6%97%B6%E9%97%B4%E4%B8%8E%E6%95%B4%E4%B8%AA%E5%91%A8%E6%9C%9F%E6%97%B6%E9%97%B4%E7%9A%84%E6%AF%94%E4%BE%8B%E3%80%82%5Cn%20%20%20%20pwm.duty_cycle%20%3D%200.00%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20%E5%BC%80%E5%90%AFPWM%E8%BE%93%E5%87%BA%5Cn%20%20%20%20pwm.enable()%5Cn%20%20%20%20while%20True%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20for%20i%20in%20range(0%2CrangeMax)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%23%20%E4%BC%91%E7%9C%A0step%E7%A7%92%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20time.sleep(step)%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%23%20%E8%AE%BE%E7%BD%AE%E5%8D%A0%E7%A9%BA%E6%AF%94%E6%AF%8F%E6%AC%A1%E5%8A%A0%20step%25%20%2C%20%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%20round%20%E9%81%BF%E5%85%8D%E6%B5%AE%E7%82%B9%E8%BF%90%E7%AE%97%E8%AF%AF%E5%B7%AE%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20pwm.duty_cycle%20%3D%20round(pwm.duty_cycle%2Bstep%2C2)%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%23%20%E5%B8%B8%E7%81%AD1%E7%A7%92%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20if%20pwm.duty_cycle%20%3D%3D%200.0%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20time.sleep(1)%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20for%20i%20in%20range(0%2CrangeMax)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20time.sleep(step)%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20pwm.duty_cycle%20%3D%20round(pwm.duty_cycle-step%2C2)%5Cnexcept%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20print(%5C%22Some%20errors%20occur!%5C%5Cn%5C%22)%5Cnfinally%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20%E9%80%80%E5%87%BA%E6%97%B6%E7%86%84%E7%81%ADLED%5Cn%20%20%20%20pwm.duty_cycle%20%3D%200.0%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20%E9%87%8A%E6%94%BE%E8%B5%84%E6%BA%90%5Cn%20%20%20%20pwm.close()%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Ot3SM%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u7d197260\" id=\"u7d197260\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc14676ec\" id=\"uc14676ec\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\">代码说明：</span></p><ul list=\"uf6f46119\"><li fid=\"u0d51014c\" data-lake-id=\"u98840cbc\" id=\"u98840cbc\"><span data-lake-id=\"u4ffab680\" id=\"u4ffab680\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\">第10行，创建了一个PWM对象</span></li><li fid=\"u0d51014c\" data-lake-id=\"u02a79a56\" id=\"u02a79a56\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6a57699e\" id=\"u6a57699e\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\">第12、14行，分别对该PWM对象的参数做了初始化，分别是PWM输出波形的频率、占空比</span></li><li fid=\"u0d51014c\" data-lake-id=\"u040a746e\" id=\"u040a746e\"><span data-lake-id=\"u68c4011e\" id=\"u68c4011e\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\">第16行，根据对应的参数，使能PWM波形输出</span></li></ul>",
